      "title": "The Dual Degree Advantage",
      "creditsRequired": 9,
      "minRequirementCount": 1,
      "requirements": [],
      "notes": [
        "The dual degree curriculum allows for the sharing of academic credit across programs. Students may count up to 9 semester hours of coursework from the JD curriculum toward the interdisciplinary and elective requirements of the MBA degree and up to 12 semester hours from the MBA curriculum toward the JD degree. Students work closely with their academic advisors from both schools to ensure appropriate course selection and progress toward their degrees."
